  "description": "A .NET Framework 4.6.1 compatible implementation of Sentence Transformers in C#. Produces embeddings using C# BERT Tokenizer and ONNX All-Mini-LM-L6-v2 model. Includes ONNX Runtime initialization helpers for legacy .NET Framework environments. Perfect for semantic search, text similarity, and embedding generation in .NET applications.",
